# Settle

Read `docs/CONTEXT.md` before coding or git.

- One GitHub slice unless Ashmit asked to run a local testable V1.
- Never `git add .` — only paths in `docs/SLICE_FILES.md` for the current slice.
- GitHub author must be Ashmit `<ashmitg25@gmail.com>`. Strip `Co-authored-by: Cursor` before push using `git commit-tree` (see CONTEXT.md). Do not change git config. Do not backdate.
- Product copy: optimized settlement plan from net balances; never “minimizes number of payments.”
- Cross-settlement: supported in architecture, default OFF, engine later.
- Expenses FK to `people`, not `users`. Money is BigDecimal / NUMERIC, never float.
- Do not invent features the spec postponed (UPI, OCR, AI write-path).
